OL,3,GNEWSALine in the sand: Council to ban
OL,4,Anew beach food vans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose objecting to the plans include a
OL,7,Fcoffee cart whose owners say the move
OL,8,Fhas halted their ambition to move into
OL,9,Fthe area.
